  "summary": "Connect general convex, mesh and thick-polyline collision generation, stable deferred sorting and reduction to resident Coulomb scenes with every frame recorded.",
  "regressions": [
    "Fifteen scenes cover all seven convex shape tags, mesh and polyline grounds, a convex stack, interleaved batches, and 1/8/120 frames.",
    "Independent geometry, witness, all-frame penetration and energy checks supplement exact metadata, allocation, sorting, capacity and copy validation.",
    "The centered cylinder scene exercises the paired Rust/TileLang near-origin GJK correction."
  ],
  "differences": [
    "The fixture controller uses full 32-bit stable radix passes for both deferred keys; this preserves order but has unqualified performance.",
    "All physics remains in native mirrored stages. Host fixture setup and dispatch composition do not provide physics fallbacks.",
    "Fixture buffers are provisioned before execution. Arbitrary runtime overflow retry and public backend selection remain pending.",
    "Native secondary-witness approximation remains explicit, diagnosed and release-blocking.",
    "Source lowering does not certify Ascend vendor compilation or execution."
  ],
